1217
01:24:21,639 --> 01:24:24,141
You sick bastard !

1218
01:24:28,646 --> 01:24:30,230
Oh, my God.

1219
01:24:30,982 --> 01:24:32,941
Is he trying to tell me something?

1220
01:24:37,781 --> 01:24:40,199
She only sings on days
she meets you.

1221
01:24:42,077 --> 01:24:44,036
